WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.500
We glide over snow-capped volcanic peaks.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.000
Above the summit, sunlit pink clouds drift slowly by.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.500
Brown slopes are streaked with wind-carved lines of snow.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.000
A turquoise lake hides in the heart of the crater.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.400
Under a blue sky, the ridges stretch to the horizon.
